   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2025-01-16",
   "text": "Medicare Hearing Aid Coverage Act of 2025\nThis bill allows for Medicare coverage of hearing aids and related examinations.\nThe Government Accountability Office must study programs that provide assistance for hearing aids and related examinations for individuals with hearing loss."
